      "sourceText": "- `std::span<T>` 是不拥有数据的连续内存视图。\n- 可以统一接收 vector、array、C 数组——一个参数类型覆盖所有。\n- 支持子视图切片（`subspan`、`first`、`last`），零拷贝。\n- span 的生命周期不能超过底层数据。\n- 只适用于连续内存容器。",
      "translatedText": "- `std::span<T>` is a contiguous view of memory that does not own the data\\.\n- It can uniformly accept vector, array, and C arrays—one parameter type covers all\\.\n- Supports subview slicing (`subspan`、`first`、`last`), with zero copy\\.\n- The lifetime of a span cannot exceed the underlying data\\.\n- It only applies to contiguous memory containers\\.",
